  "title": "task-reopen：closed → rework（owner 授权、写 ledger）",
  "objective": {
    "problem": "071 在 A 方案中被 closed 后才 rebase；checkback 只允许 delivered/reviewed/rework/accepted，closed 卡无法重审，导致只能回滚。生命周期缺少合法 reopen 出口。",
    "outcome": "新增 task-reopen（owner-only）：closed 卡 → rework，写 TASK_REOPEN（primary ledger），保留 record/REVIEW/envelope 历史；不伪造 merge/verified；reopen 后可重新 checkback/accept/close。",
    "approach": "tower_ledger_replay 加 TASK_REOPEN→rework、转移表 closed→rework；tower_task/CLI 加命令与 owner 校验；EVENT_CATALOG 登记；补测试。",
    "non_goals_and_done": "不复用 MERGED/VERIFIED；不删除 review/envelope；753+ tests；reopen 后 checkback 可走通。"
  },
  "authority": "workspace_write",
  "anchor": "ADR-0005 / 071 closed-reopen deadlock",
  "why_now": "071 的 code 已 PASS，但 closed 卡无法换 head 重审；没有 reopen，任何 rebase-only 重审都只能回滚。",
  "scope": [
